  "releaseNotes": "heap picking: a `HeapNode` registers its pickable bucket with the pick context so one `HeapRenderObject` (N parts → 1 draw) still resolves clicks per part — via the heap's per-slot `HeapPickId` SSBO — and `SceneHandler` routes the pickable bundle through the PickId attachment pass, gating the decoder by pick mode (`pickModes`). Deregistration is wired through the bucket's per-slot free callback.\nbumped to Aardvark.Rendering/SceneGraph 5.7.0-prerelease0027 (heap O(1) picking: `ofRenderObjectsPicking` + `HeapRenderObject.IsPickable` + per-slot deregister).",
